ices":32,"firstPublicationDate":176},"evri-group-boosts-growth-with-over-3700-new-community-courier-warehouse-driver-and-head-office-roles",{"title":8,"category":9,"metaDescription":10,"canonical":11,"titleTag":12,"featuredImage":13,"publishedDate":31,"slices":32},"Evri Group boosts growth with over 3700 new community courier, warehouse, driver and head office roles ",null,"Read about how Evri Group boosts growth with over 3700 new community courier, warehouse, driver and head office roles ","evri-group-boosts-growth-with-over-3700-new-community-courier-warehouse-driver-and-head-office-roles.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fpress\u002Fevri-group-boosts-growth-with-over-3700-new-community-courier-warehouse-driver-and-head-office-roles","Evri Group boosts growth with over 3700 new community courier, warehouse, driver and head office roles | Evri",{"dimensions":14,"alt":17,"copyright":9,"url":18,"id":19,"edit":20,"thumbnail":24},{"width":15,"height":16},960,640,"A parcel in waterproof blue packaging is being handed to a recipient at the door. A blue Evri van can be seen in the background.","evri-group-boosts-growth-with-over-3700-new-community-courier-warehouse-driver-and-head-office-roles.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y9MZbqstJ9-iHb_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9013.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,1,8192,5461&w=960&h=640","Z6y9MZbqstJ9-iHb",{"x":21,"y":22,"zoom":22,"background":23},0,1,"transparent",{"dimensions":25,"alt":17,"copyright":9,"url":28,"id":19,"edit":29},{"width":26,"height":27},384,182,"evri-group-boosts-growth-with-over-3700-new-community-courier-warehouse-driver-and-head-office-roles.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y9MZbqstJ9-iHb_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9013.jpg?auto=format,compress&rect=0,791,8192,3883&w=384&h=182",{"x":21,"y":30,"zoom":22,"background":23},791,"2026-02-23",[33,104,111,117],{"variation":34,"version":35,"items":36,"primary":38,"id":102,"slice_type":103,"slice_label":9},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[37],{},{"content":39},[40,49,54,57,60,63,66,69,72,75,78,99],{"type":41,"text":42,"spans":43,"direction":48},"paragraph","·       Jobs creation supports quality commitment as Evri ranks highest in UK for on-time delivery rates ",[44],{"start":45,"end":46,"type":47},8,105,"strong","ltr",{"type":41,"text":50,"spans":51,"direction":48},"·       As hiring falls in the logistics sector, Evri Group bucks the trend with thousands of new roles to drive service quality and continued growth ",[52],{"start":45,"end":53,"type":47},150,{"type":41,"text":55,"spans":56,"direction":48}," ",[],{"type":41,"text":58,"spans":59,"direction":48},"Evri Group is announcing plans to create over 3700 new opportunities with a particular focus in operations on courier roles at the heart of local communities to drive up delivery quality.",[],{"type":41,"text":61,"spans":62,"direction":48},"The announcement follows operational investment of £36 million last year as the business bolstered its operations and service to support parcel volume growth.",[],{"type":41,"text":64,"spans":65,"direction":48},"This latest investment builds on Evri’s commitment to delivering industry leading service, with close to 4 million 5* Trustpilot reviews and an average courier star rating of 4.7\u002F5, while underpinning its rapid growth following its merger with DHL eCommerce UK. In the last week alone independent data from Parcel2Go found that for UK deliveries, Evri Drop-Off recorded the highest on-time delivery rate in 2025 of all carriers. The same report also ranked Evri Drop-Off as having one of the highest rankings (top 3) for customer satisfaction for International deliveries at 4.54 out of 5. ",[],{"type":41,"text":67,"spans":68,"direction":48},"Evri’s focus on bringing in 3700 new workers including community couriers supports its commitment to further driving service quality as data highlights higher customer",[],{"type":41,"text":70,"spans":71,"direction":48},"satisfaction rates towards couriers that deliver regular rounds and know their communities well.",[],{"type":41,"text":73,"spans":74,"direction":48},"For couriers themselves, the business offers them the opportunity to drive their own earnings, benefit from the flexibility of being self-employed all whilst earning significantly more than national minimum wage with average rates of £20 per hour for established couriers. Regular round holders also have the opportunity to convert to be a GMB union backed Evri Plus courier which opens up access to holiday pay (28 days annually), pension contributions, dedicated delivery round(s) and guaranteed minimum earnings.",[],{"type":41,"text":76,"spans":77,"direction":48},"In addition to courier positions, Evri Group is also hiring for self-employed driver roles across the UK with opportunities to earn as much as £1200 a week for experienced drivers, as well as a range of opportunities at all levels within its warehouse and head office functions.",[],{"type":41,"text":79,"spans":80,"direction":48},"For courier opportunities, roles are open nationwide across the UK, those interested can find out more and apply here.  Self-employed driver vacancies with Evri Premium, a network of DHL, are open UK wide and more information is available here. Head office roles which offer hybrid working opportunities range from graduate positions earning £27,000 per annum through to warehouse opportunities and senior IT and management roles earning upwards of £85,000 per annum. All vacancies can be found here.",[81,89,94],{"start":82,"end":83,"type":84,"data":85},113,117,"hyperlink",{"link_type":86,"url":87,"target":88},"Web","evri-group-boosts-growth-with-over-3700-new-community-courier-warehouse-driver-and-head-office-roles.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fbeacourier","_blank",{"start":90,"end":91,"type":84,"data":92},239,244,{"link_type":86,"url":93,"target":88},"evri-group-boosts-growth-with-over-3700-new-community-courier-warehouse-driver-and-head-office-roles.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fcareers\u002Fself-employed-van-driver",{"start":95,"end":96,"type":84,"data":97},495,499,{"link_type":86,"url":98,"target":88},"evri-group-boosts-growth-with-over-3700-new-community-courier-warehouse-driver-and-head-office-roles.html\u002F\u002Fevricareer.com\u002FCareers\u002F2022%20Multipage%20Microsite-1995\u002FSearch%20Jobs?SiteID=3680",{"type":41,"text":100,"spans":101,"direction":48},"",[],"rich_text$3e17074e-984c-431f-af68-ac47b28f726f","rich_text",{"variation":34,"version":35,"items":105,"primary":106,"id":109,"slice_type":110,"slice_label":9},[],{"quoteText":107,"quoteSource":108},"We’re a global business that hasn’t forgotten its local roots and our customers tell us they appreciate the service given by regular community couriers that get to know their customers. We’re delivering a billion parcels now, but each one matters and as the highest ranked provider for on time deliveries in the UK, we’re committed to investing in creating the roles our customers want as we strive to keep offering higher standards of service that continually raise the bar.","Gary Robinson Group Director Final Mile at Evri Group","quote$97e50289-4016-4846-b246-75087b70aa77","quote",{"variation":34,"version":35,"items":112,"primary":113,"id":116,"slice_type":110,"slice_label":9},[],{"quoteText":114,"quoteSource":115},"We’re a Group with an exciting future and colleagues joining us benefit from access to fast growth business where they can develop their skills and own their own career with the flexibility to work in a way that works for them. In the last week alone, we have launched a new apprenticeship scheme designed to strengthen data and artificial intelligence (AI) skills across our workforce, highlighting our commitment to supporting our talent to grow and evolve their roles working hand in hand with the latest advancements in technology","Lyn Warren, Chief HR officer for Evri Group","quote$d58fa2a3-46e1-47c2-b5e5-e65b945fc77b",{"variation":34,"version":35,"items":118,"primary":119,"id":175,"slice_type":103,"slice_label":9},[],{"content":120},[121,123,128,130,135,143,146,151,154,157,160,163,171,173],{"type":41,"text":100,"spans":122,"direction":48},[],{"type":41,"text":124,"spans":125,"direction":48},"-ENDS-",[126],{"start":21,"end":127,"type":47},6,{"type":41,"text":55,"spans":129,"direction":48},[],{"type":41,"text":131,"spans":132,"direction":48},"Media enquiries  ",[133],{"start":21,"end":134,"type":47},17,{"type":41,"text":136,"spans":137,"direction":48},"For any enquiries relating to Evri Group or its companies; Evri, DHL eCommerce UK, UK Mail and Coll-8, please contact: prteam@evri.com",[138],{"start":139,"end":140,"type":84,"data":141},119,134,{"link_type":86,"url":142,"target":88},"mailto:prteam@evri.com",{"type":41,"text":55,"spans":144,"direction":48},[145],{"start":21,"end":22,"type":47},{"type":41,"text":147,"spans":148,"direction":48},"About Evri  ",[149],{"start":21,"end":150,"type":47},12,{"type":41,"text":152,"spans":153,"direction":48},"Evri Group brings together Evri, DHL eCommerce UK – which in 2026 will be rebranded Evri Premium, a network of DHL - customs clearance and logistics specialist Coll-8 and business letters leader UK Mail, to create the UK’s premier parcel delivery company. The combined Evri Group will deliver more than 1 billion parcels and a further 1 billion business letters annually.",[],{"type":41,"text":155,"spans":156,"direction":48},"Evri, the core operating brand, currently delivers around 900 million parcels a year, and is on a mission to be the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels, without costing the earth.",[],{"type":41,"text":158,"spans":159,"direction":48},"Working with everyone from Europe’s top retailers, marketplaces and pre-loved sites to gift-givers, the roots of Evri can be traced back to Yorkshire in 1974. The business has grown over the last five decades and now has a team of 12,000+ employees and 30,000+ couriers, as well as a growing network of more than 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers and 500+ state-of-the-art hubs and depots.  Following its acquisition of Coll-8, an Irish independent customs clearance and logistics specialist, and merger with DHL eCommerce UK, Evri Group continues to enhance its international capability and enable world trade.",[],{"type":41,"text":161,"spans":162,"direction":48},"Evri has close to 4 million independent 5-star Trustpilot reviews, an average courier rating of 4.6\u002F5, reflecting a strong commitment to customer experience.",[],{"type":41,"text":164,"spans":165,"direction":48},"For more info: www.evri.com\u002Fnews-and-corporate ",[166],{"start":167,"end":168,"type":84,"data":169},15,46,{"link_type":86,"url":170,"target":88},"evri-group-boosts-growth-with-over-3700-new-community-courier-warehouse-driver-and-head-office-roles.html\u002F\u002Furldefense.com\u002Fv3\u002F__http:\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fnews-and-corporate__;!!KZXpRQ!XXp1b6auPQhqEikzO24Td1WLLcOiKei-_sEGnaz1LXy6FIZdIH744ZKALMLghNBHhvufy1YVkeCCqssIjm9R-A$",{"type":41,"text":55,"spans":172,"direction":48},[],{"type":41,"text":100,"spans":174,"direction":48},[],"rich_text$b4cde17a-1573-4cf4-a47a-843950f56d16","2026-03-05T14:15:04+0000",["Reactive",178],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":179,"$sclients":247,"$sglobal-basket-count":9},{"abtasty":180,"accessibe":184,"appPromoBanner":187,"autoDivertUpdates":191,"awin":194,"bulkInternational":197,"bulkSendEnabled":200,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":203,"enableBasketCount":206,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":209,"euCustomsDuty":212,"groovyAdvert":215,"newInternationalSendFlow":218,"newinternationalpages":225,"oohPreferenceFlag":229,"opentel":232,"premium":235,"savedCards":238,"smallParcelSize":241,"yourPricesDrawer":244},{"_createdAt":181,"_updatedAt":182,"enabled":183},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",true,{"_createdAt":185,"_updatedAt":186,"enabled":183},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":188,"_updatedAt":189,"enabled":190},"2026-03-06T12:16